  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "IDFC FIRST LIC Classic Credit Card is a co-branded credit option built around insurance-related and everyday spends. It offers 1 reward point for every Rs. 125 spent, 6X on LIC insurance premiums and 3X on groceries, utilities, railways, FASTag, education, and government payments. Other transactions also earn 3X rewards. Through the travel section, cardholders can get 20% bonus points on hotel bookings and 10% on flights. The card also includes 8 domestic lounge visits annually and 4 railway lounge accesses. Benefits include insurance cover up to Rs. 2 lakh, Rs. 25,000 lost card liability protection, roadside assistance worth Rs. 1,399, fuel surcharge waiver of 1% capped at Rs. 300, and no joining or annual fees.",
